    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget mercy. Forget salvation. There is nothing here but blood, steel, and light from cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where ancient Slavic rites are intertwined with the ashes of future technology, you are the last warrior of the Varangian Guard. Against you are hordes of cyber-mutants, obsessed cultists and traitors who have sold their flesh and faith for the power of a dark cult. In the style of Slavic Gothic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real boomer-shooter - old-school gameplay in the spirit of DOOM II, Duke Nukem and Quake. No cover, no reloading. Just you and your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult tech - an arsenal ranging from axes and archaic shotguns to and damn futuristic cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimdark universe - a mix of Slavic gothic and techno-cult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim enemies - from cultists, magi, sagittarians to cybernatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim locations - forgotten kapisches, industrial necropolises, ancient citadels and throne halls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack - True Metal</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget mercy. Forget salvation. There is nothing here but blood, steel, and light from cannons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where ancient Slavic rites are intertwined with the ashes of future technology, you are the last warrior of the Varangian Guard. Against you are hordes of cyber-mutants, obsessed cultists and traitors who have sold their flesh and faith for the power of a dark cult. In the style of Slavic Gothic.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real boomer-shooter - old-school gameplay in the spirit of DOOM II, Duke Nukem and Quake. No cover, no reloading. Just you and your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult tech - an arsenal ranging from axes and archaic shotguns to and damn futuristic cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimdark universe - a mix of Slavic gothic and techno-cult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim enemies - from cultists, magi, sagittarians to cybernatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim locations - forgotten kapisches, industrial necropolises, ancient citadels and throne halls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack - True Metal</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Old-school boomer shooter in a world where Slavic myths have merged with technocult. Cut, shoot and survive among cultists, cyber-mutants and traitors in armor. Restore the glory of the Varangian Guard - through blood, steel and ancient wrath.",
